ne my age is stuffy in the morning, right?"], [6.78, 10.48, "Then I noticed it was only ever one side, the side I was sleeping on."], [10.84, 14.64, "If it's always the lower nostril, the side you're lying on, that's not pollen."], [14.96, 16.86, "Pollen doesn't care which side you sleep on."], [17.08, 20.36, "If it switches sides when you roll over, that's not just your sinuses."], [20.68, 22.9, "That's the trigger that follows your face around the pillow."], [23.24, 25.22, "And if it clears within minutes of standing up,"], [25.42, 27.32, "and it's gone a week you sleep somewhere else,"], [27.5, 28.78, "then nobody's telling you this."], [28.78, 30.5, "The problem never leaves your bed."], [30.8, 32.6, "It's the most common thing living in a mattress."], [33.1, 33.82, "Just mites."], [33.9, 37.5, "A colony of 100,000 to 10 million of them, deep in the fibers,"], [37.92, 39.64, "feeding on the skin you shed every night."], [39.94, 42.8, "Right there, inches from your face, for eight hours a night."], [43.0, 43.66, "And the worst part?"], [43.88, 46.84, "Your bedroom can look spotless, because none of this is in the room."], [47.16, 51.34, "It's inside the mattress, where no wash, spray, or vacuum ever reaches."], [51.72, 53.22, "But here's what actually fixes this."], [53.54, 54.1, "Capture cards."], [54.44, 55.98, "Most mite products try to kill them."], [56.22, 57.28, "This one pulls them out."], [57.28, 60.96, "A plant-derived pheromone lure draws the mites up out of the deep fibers."], [61.3, 62.8, "The adhesive locks them on the card,"], [63.06, 66.1, "so what it catches comes out of your bed, instead of back into it."], [66.28, 69.4, "Slide one under the mattress, one near the pillow, and let them work."], [69.62, 71.12, "The colony comes out of the mattress."], [71.48, 72.52, "The card shows you how much."], [72.8, 74.84, "And one card keeps going for about three months."], [75.22, 77.78, "Over 30,000 homes are already sleeping cleaner."], [78.08, 80.22, "90-day money-back guarantee, link below."]]}